  "releaseNotes": "<PackageReleaseNotes>\n        v3.2.1 (2026-06-06): Documentation and Performance Enhancements\n\n        DOCUMENTATION IMPROVEMENTS:\n        • Enhanced XML documentation for ValueFormatter class with comprehensive method-level docs\n        • Added performance notes explaining AggressiveInlining decisions for hot-path methods\n        • Documented design rationale for complex formatting methods (Type, Stream, Dictionary, ITuple)\n        • Updated TestDataExpected.GetExpected() docs with performance characteristics\n        • Added usage context and caller information across all formatter methods\n\n        PERFORMANCE DOCUMENTATION:\n        • Documented hot-path optimizations: Format(char) with ASCII caching, Format(string), FallbackIfNull\n        • Explained JoinWithComma fast path for List&lt;string&gt; with 0-3 items\n        • Clarified why complex methods (reflection-based, exception handling) are not inlined\n\n        No breaking changes. All improvements are documentation-only for better API understanding and maintainability.\n      </PackageReleaseNotes>",
